# Paper 1 — version control
#
# This repository versions the TEXT artefacts: analysis code, documentation, the manuscript, the
# result tables that the manuscript cites, and the figure PDFs. Everything else on this exfat volume
# is large, regenerable pipeline state (33 GB) and is deliberately excluded.
#
# What is tracked:      R/*.R, tools/, Docs/, Manuscript/, metadata/, reference/, environment/,
#                       handoff.md, AUDIT_*.md, output/figures/, output/tables/*.csv (with exceptions)
# What is NOT tracked:  work/ (23 GB), .Rlib/ (4.2 GB), scrna/extracted (3.3 GB), logs/, and the
#                       bulk CSVs listed below — all regenerable by the scripts they came from.

# --- pipeline state (regenerable) ---
work/
.Rlib/
.reasonix/
logs/
scrna/extracted/
scrna/raw/

# --- figure sources are kept, intermediate per-step figure dirs are not ---
output/deg/
output/enrichment/
output/scrna/
output/subtypes/
output/wgcna/
output/qc/
output/tables/deg/
output/tables/meta/
output/tables/enrichment/

# --- bulk tables (>3 MB each, all regenerated by the numbered scripts) ---
output/tables/scrna_pseudobulk_de.csv
output/tables/08f_module_enrichment_all.csv
output/tables/scrna_detection_fraction.csv
output/tables/deg_all_significant.csv
output/tables/signature_matrix.csv

# --- R session spill ---
*.RData
permutedStats-actualModules*.RData
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user/

# --- editors / OS ---
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp

# --- LaTeX intermediates (the compositor stages these itself) ---
work/figtex/
*.aux
*.log
